#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1362 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "THE ALL-FACET GATE, NEW WITH THE R-5.25 SPLIT (top-level-or board wave 1, \u00a74), for the actual-arm pair: the parent keeps empty(ACTARMCD) and not empty(ACTARM), the gated dataset here omits ACTARM entirely so the parent is silent by polarity, but the SIBLING's empty(ACTARM) leaf is what makes the two-variable gate load-bearing; both halves carry All [ACTARMCD, ACTARM]. Ruling in documentation/derivation/absent-column-verdicts.tsv. If this scenario EXECUTES, the gate has been removed: escalate, do not rewrite the pin."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | B
